    "removed_work": "One detached complete state() deep copy and conversion of unrelated route/action/timeline vectors per successful source-error call, replaced by fresh source_id plus the exact same Codec.read_vector3 of authored.tether_position. Number of actual dynamic calls is unmeasured.",
    "preserved": "Full fresh immutable snapshot validation, original wire bounds, two role/catalogue resolves and later fresh catalogue check, actual source getter once at its original position, native post-getter identity checks, fresh floor/collision, staged definition/fallback path, all native guards, callback guards, time/clock/error ordering and complete binding validation.",
    "proof": "The local ReplayProgram is constructed exact and its factory checks exact Script before constructing an exact Authored reader. The validated wire is privately duplicated; no callback/getter/yield occurs before reading identity. Scheduler only reads plan.source_id and plan.authored.tether_position. Those values retain original string/native Vector3 conversion; no mutable dictionary/array escapes. Exact-script fallback calls the original state() for legitimate subclass behavior. This projection grants no accepted flag or cached authority.",
    "limits": "Source proof only. No speed, FPS, causal attribution or acceptance credit. If unexpected internal state or subclass behavior differs under meaningful controls, withdraw the projection."
  },
